senses.gloss:
--(also पातालम्) the underworld of rocky soil. Here live पणिस्, नागस्, निवातकवचस् and कालेयस्; all दानवस् of great strength and enterprising spirit and afraid of Hari and Sarama, the messenger of Indra.
1: भा. V. २४. 7 and ३०; Br. II. १९. १७१; २०. १० and १२, ३९-40; ३०. ३१; M. ४७. ६३; वा. ४९. १६३; ९७. ९५; १००. १५७; Vi. IV. 3. 4 and 8; V. 1. २८.
Visited by Arjuna in search of the dead child of the द्वारका Brahmana;
2: भा. X. ८९. ४४.
burnt by Pralaya;
3: Br. III. ५३. 1; ७२. ९६. ७३. ४६ and ४८; IV. 1. १५३.
the Asuras entered it help- less;
4: M. ४७. २१२-13, २३३.
Vasu, cursed by the sages to live there, for his decision against the killing of पशु in sacrifices;
5: Ib. १४३. २४-25; १६६. 3; २४८, 4, ११, ५३, ६७ff; वा. ५७. ११०.
of १०,000 Yojanas in extent; other talams are Atala, Sutala, Vitala, Gabhastala, महातल, Sritala, and पताल with the characteristics of black, white, पीतम्, chunam, rocky and gold they are in groups of earth, water and space.
6: Ib. 6. २५; ५०. 9-१४.
